{
  "runs": [
    [
      {
        "paceMs": 30,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Let me look at the ring first."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_list",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_suggest",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "aspect": "1:1"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 30,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "thinking",
            "thinking": "A four-claw solitaire with a round centre stone: the hero three-quarter, the profile for the gallery, and a macro on the stone. No saved shots. Ask what the pictures are for, the shapes and the motion, with the defaults ready."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "chat_ask",
            "input": {
              "intro": "A four-claw solitaire with a round centre stone, about 1 ct. Three quick choices, and the defaults are ready if you just press Go.",
              "questions": "{{questions}}"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 30,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Doing it: three stills on studio white (hero three-quarter, profile for the gallery, a macro on the stone) and a short 360° turntable, all square, at draft size so you can judge them quickly. I am placing each camera now and will check the framing before anything renders."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Hero three-quarter",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": "{{suggest:hero}}",
                "sparkle": 0.6,
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Profile",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": {
                  "preset": "custom",
                  "position": [
                    0,
                    -40,
                    6
                  ],
                  "target": [
                    0,
                    0,
                    6
                  ],
                  "focalLength": 100
                },
                "sparkle": 0.6,
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Macro on the stone",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": "{{suggest:macro}}",
                "sparkle": 0.6,
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Turntable",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": "{{suggest:hero}}",
                "sparkle": 0.6,
                "output": {
                  "width": 256,
                  "height": 256,
                  "quality": "preview"
                },
                "animation": {
                  "type": "turntable",
                  "seconds": 1,
                  "fps": 24
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Checking the framing of all four through their own cameras."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_capture",
            "input": {
              "ids": [
                "{{shot1}}",
                "{{shot2}}",
                "{{shot3}}",
                "{{shot4}}"
              ],
              "size": 320
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hero, macro and turntable frame well. The **Profile** is cut off: that camera stands too close in front. Moving its camera round to the side, at eye level, so the gallery under the stone shows."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_update",
            "input": {
              "id": "{{shot2}}",
              "patch": {
                "camera": "{{suggest:profile}}"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_capture",
            "input": {
              "ids": [
                "{{shot2}}"
              ],
              "size": 320
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The profile holds the whole ring now. Rendering the three stills and the turntable."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{shot1}}",
              "title": "Hero three-quarter"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{shot2}}",
              "title": "Profile"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{shot3}}",
              "title": "Macro on the stone"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{shot4}}",
              "title": "Turntable"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "thinking",
            "thinking": "Hero: the stone faces the lens and the claws are crisp. Profile: the gallery and the head height read. Macro: the table and claws are sharp, the band falls soft. The turntable loops; I cannot watch it, only its poster."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The set is in. **Hero three-quarter**: the stone faces the lens and the claws are crisp against the white. **Profile**: the gallery under the stone and the height of the head read clearly. **Macro**: the table and claws are sharp, with the band falling soft behind. The **turntable** is a one-second loop at draft size; I cannot watch video, so play it in the filmstrip and say if the speed or angle should change. Swap, star or set a cover as you like."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  ]
}